INT: Yeah.

EL: They had nothing. They didn't have a piece of bread in the house.

INT: Right.

EL: They didn't have anything. They had-- you know, after Pesach. And there-- it wasn't like here, that you have loads of stuff you put away and after Pesach you take it out.

